IAU Standards of Fundamental Astronomy (SOFA)

AstronomyKit includes the unchanged official SOFA 2023-10-11 C source archive and astrometry example under Scripts/reference-data/sources/sofa. Scripts/reference-data/sofa-fixed-star-reference.c is AstronomyKit-authored integration code that calls the official routines for the legacy no-proper-motion fixture. Scripts/sofa-star-motion-reference.c calls unchanged SOFA pmsafe, starpm, pmpx and tdbtcb routines for independent catalog-motion qualification. Sources/AstronomyKit/Engine/Stars/EngineStarCatalogPropagation.swift is a specialized Swift adaptation of the same pmsafe, starpm, starpv, pmpx and tdbtcb computations: it returns a propagated position instead of updated catalog rates, includes the observer-dependent reception-time term, and rejects every SOFA warning instead of returning a status. Its routine and type names do not use SOFA's reserved prefix. AstronomyKit and these derived works do not constitute software provided by or endorsed by SOFA.

