JPL Horizons Chiron states

Sources/AstronomyKit/Engine/Gravity/Generated/Chiron/ChironCoefficients.swift contains Chebyshev coefficients fitted to heliocentric states of 2060 Chiron (solution JPL#171, ICRF, geometric, JD TDB 2415019.5 through 2506333.5) retrieved from NASA/JPL Horizons (https://ssd.jpl.nasa.gov/horizons/). Scripts/chiron-data pins the Horizons queries and responses with their SHA-256 hashes, and Scripts/reference-data/sources/horizons/chiron-anchor-vector.json records separate Horizons states for comparison. The fitted table and its evaluator are AstronomyKit-derived representations, not JPL software or an endorsement by JPL.

